@page "/profile"

<PageTitle>Corporate Profile</PageTitle>


<!-- Page Header -->
<section class="hero fade-in" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <div class="terminal-status">> EXECUTING: /profile</div>
    <h1 class="main-heading">The Billennium <strong>Advantage.</strong></h1>
    <p class="sub-heading">
        Uncompromising precision. Zero agency bloat. Delivering enterprise-grade software architecture through integrated engineering teams.
    </p>
</section>

<!-- Main Content Grid -->
<section class="architect-grid">

    <!-- Left Column: The Ethos -->
    <div class="bio-text fade-in delay-1">
        <p>
            Established by Senior Software Engineer Mehmet Bilen, the <strong>BILLENNIUM</strong> moniker is a direct extension of the founder's name—representing a personal guarantee of architectural excellence, transparent communication, and next-generation code quality.
        </p>
        <p>
            Enterprise software development often suffers from the "agency illusion"—clients are sold on a vision by senior architects, only to have their core infrastructure handed off to disconnected layers of non-technical management.
        </p>
        <p>
            BILLENNIUM LIMITED operates differently. Built as a highly specialized engineering capability, we guarantee that every architectural decision, every cloud migration strategy, and every line of core backend logic is executed directly by our elite technical team.
        </p>

        <p class="highlight">
            > "Direct execution means zero signal degradation. When technical challenges arise, there is no convoluted communication chain—only immediate, expert resolution."
        </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Terminal Profile Card -->
    <div class="terminal-card fade-in delay-2">
        <div class="card-header">
            // CORPORATE_PROFILE
        </div>
        <ul class="spec-list">
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> ENTITY_NAME</span>
                <span class="spec-value">BILLENNIUM LIMITED</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> CORPORATE_REGISTRY</span>
                <span class="spec-value">ENGLAND & WALES (CRN: 12871348)</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> INCORPORATION_DATE</span>
                <span class="spec-value">10 September 2020</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> FOUNDING_DIRECTOR</span>
                <span class="spec-value">Mehmet Bilen</span>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> OPERATIONAL_BASE</span>
                <span class="spec-value">London, United Kingdom</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</section>